				<key>WFCommentActionText</key>
				<string>Share an image, video, text or link to Óia! Choose the inbox folder inside your iCloud Óia library during setup. Each item is saved as a complete archive with its capture type; Óia imports it on your Mac. The shared Rust engine resolves links, categories and selected-text highlights. Direct image links download the image. Instagram posts queue the selected slide for download on your Mac. No accounts.</string>
